    "turn_text": "So, you know, if you're operating a blog in Egypt, for example, you become a disseminator of information that can serve. So information because of social media is used for informational purposes, but also for aspirational purposes. And that's when you see these revolutions rising up in Russia today with young people in Egypt, with the first Arab Spring. All throughout the world it is ignited by social media because most of these regimes, these repressive regimes, have been good at what? Repression. and that is keeping people separated and making sure that people don't have the information they need to organize. So it's changing the face of everything, both here in Western New York and the nation, but throughout the world.",
