    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/1/81182.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "Now, in Congress, you have a Great Lakes consortium of colleagues that you interact with. What are those conversations like when it comes to rebuilding cities? I'm guessing Pittsburgh and Cleveland and other cities like that are engaged with us.",
