    "turn_idx": 27,
    "turn_text": "You know, it's funny to bring up Thomas Friedman. I've said on the last two shows that I've done, I've brought his name up because I was at a party with him and they, you know, there's probably 50 people there and they stopped it for a second and said, can you just talk about our country? And this was a few years ago. And he said, you know, I often tell people in the US, if you want to be successful, you have to do two things. Think like a waitress and think like a refugee. Think and act like a refugee.",
