    "turn_text": "Can you talk a bit about you know, what's going on with immigration, you know, I don't think Buffalo is a sanctuary city, but that's kind of what everybody's talking about these days. Can you talk about kind of your perspective on where we are with that? Because immigration has been and refugees who came over here. I mean, they've started some of the greatest businesses in the United States that are driving our economy today. So.",
