    "turn_text": "To be truthful, Matt, I think that it's taken for granted that that is a priority for them. It's what distinguishes them. They seem to understand there's no need for historic preservation movement because everybody appreciates the great history that surrounds them. That's what defines these cities. We sometimes have to push people in that direction. As you know, you constantly have",
