    "turn_text": "A lot of it has to do with infrastructure to support these great developments. One of the questions that I have been thinking about, I drive an electric vehicle and I know as we're talking about putting investment into infrastructure, a lot of the money comes from the gas tax. If Elon Musk is correct and we move to EVs, is that a big debate or conversation in Congress as to what are we doing here? It might not be that big of a number today, but he just got a million orders or something for his next vehicle. What's going to happen? Is that a topic of conversation and what are people thinking? No, and it should be.",
